(7651902, 1245161, 103142, '<td valign="top">seems over sharpened and a bit oversaturated... Cool bird in cool surroundings, though!</td>', 'seems over sharpened and a bit oversaturated... Cool bird in cool surroundings, though!', '2020-01-29 11:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651903, 1245335, 103142, '<td valign="top">Wow... It took me awhile to figure this one out, but gave a great first impression. I''d be tempted to crop it in, though. The upper right quarter doesn''t add that much and the whole left side is awesome.</td>', 'Wow... It took me awhile to figure this one out, but gave a great first impression. I''d be tempted to crop it in, though. The upper right quarter doesn''t add that much and the whole left side is awesome.', '2020-01-29 11:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651904, 1244818, 61234, '<td valign="top">Impressive!</td>', 'Impressive!', '2020-01-29 11:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651905, 1244909, 61234, '<td valign="top">Amazing and Awe-Inspiring!</td>', 'Amazing and Awe-Inspiring!', '2020-01-29 11:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651906, 1244893, 103142, '<td valign="top">great find, but it was either not sharp to begin with or processed too much. I keep trying to focus better with my eyes. I think you could have gotten away with it if you had overexposed it and made it a bit soft and dreamy.</td>', 'great find, but it was either not sharp to begin with or processed too much. I keep trying to focus better with my eyes. I think you could have gotten away with it if you had overexposed it and made it a bit soft and dreamy.', '2020-01-29 11:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651907, 1245265, 61234, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! One of my top picks!</td>', 'Fantastic! One of my top picks!', '2020-01-29 11:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651908, 1244902, 61234, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!</td>', 'Gorgeous!', '2020-01-29 11:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651909, 1245104, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen these shots a number of times in previous challenges. Very nice. Although what bothers me a bit is that whatever software you used to make a dark to light circular gradient has left rings. I can see each individual ring getting darker as you go out. I''ve also had that problem with photos when using the NIK software.</td>', 'I''ve seen these shots a number of times in previous challenges. Very nice. Although what bothers me a bit is that whatever software you used to make a dark to light circular gradient has left rings. I can see each individual ring getting darker as you go out. I''ve also had that problem with photos when using the NIK software.', '2020-01-29 11:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651913, 1245075, 181847, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Eyes in focus. Colors a little to overdone.</td>', 'Nice composition. Eyes in focus. Colors a little to overdone.', '2020-01-29 11:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651914, 1244902, 181847, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W is OK. Wonder what it looks like in color.</td>', 'B&W is OK. Wonder what it looks like in color.', '2020-01-29 11:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651915, 1244941, 181847, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF. Halo around edges hint of a little over processing.</td>', 'Nice DOF. Halo around edges hint of a little over processing.', '2020-01-29 11:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651917, 1244774, 181847, '<td valign="top">Eyes are in focus but would like to see more DOF. I know that is difficult with macro.</td>', 'Eyes are in focus but would like to see more DOF. I know that is difficult with macro.', '2020-01-29 11:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651918, 1244791, 181847, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting Sharp focus and adequate DOF</td>', 'Nice lighting Sharp focus and adequate DOF', '2020-01-29 11:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651919, 1245283, 181847, '<td valign="top">Men aren''t well focused. Fence is distracting as is blown our clouds in upper left.</td>', 'Men aren''t well focused. Fence is distracting as is blown our clouds in upper left.', '2020-01-29 11:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651920, 1245186, 181847, '<td valign="top">Technically good, no over/under exposed areas.</td>', 'Technically good, no over/under exposed areas.', '2020-01-29 11:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651921, 1245291, 181847, '<td valign="top">Terrestrial part of scene is under exposed considering this appears to have been shot with moonlight. Longer exposure would have provided more light on mountain and longer star trails. Sorry I''m not a fan of star trails.</td>', 'Terrestrial part of scene is under exposed considering this appears to have been shot with moonlight. Longer exposure would have provided more light on mountain and longer star trails. Sorry I''m not a fan of star trails.', '2020-01-29 11:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651922, 1245330, 181847, '<td valign="top">Well exposed. Well focused and nice DOF.</td>', 'Well exposed. Well focused and nice DOF.', '2020-01-29 11:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651923, 1245138, 181847, '<td valign="top">Eyes are tack sharp and rest of fox is too. Great shot</td>', 'Eyes are tack sharp and rest of fox is too. Great shot', '2020-01-29 11:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7651924, 1245331, 181847, '<td valign="top">Good focus. A little too busy.</td>', 'Good focus. A little too busy.', '2020-01-29 11:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
