(7651960, 1245243, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love action shots and you caught some really nice dust and dirt action. But it''s really hard to tell what we''re looking at. I''m guessing this is a one-wheel...? But it looks like he''s a pitcher, and just threw a weird toy car of some sort...</td>', 'I love action shots and you caught some really nice dust and dirt action. But it''s really hard to tell what we''re looking at. I''m guessing this is a one-wheel...? But it looks like he''s a pitcher, and just threw a weird toy car of some sort...', '2020-01-29 13:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
