(7652027, 1245186, 61971, '<td valign="top">Interesting building. Although I think it would have been better shifted left a tad to have that side of the building in the view.</td>', 'Interesting building. Although I think it would have been better shifted left a tad to have that side of the building in the view.', '2020-01-30 08:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652029, 1244823, 61971, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bracelet. imo the fabric is competing with my attention though. Artistically I like the idea of having the fabric give you the color that you can imagine the bracelet would have if it were real. But the print being light on orange doesn''t have that effect. This would be a cool piece for a macro shot.</td>', 'Beautiful bracelet. imo the fabric is competing with my attention though. Artistically I like the idea of having the fabric give you the color that you can imagine the bracelet would have if it were real. But the print being light on orange doesn''t have that effect. This would be a cool piece for a macro shot.', '2020-01-30 08:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652030, 1245103, 61971, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast that you have in this. The posts being out of focus is distracting to me though.</td>', 'I love the contrast that you have in this. The posts being out of focus is distracting to me though.', '2020-01-30 08:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652031, 1245280, 61971, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract. I think I would have liked it more with a tighter crop to the places that are the sharpest.</td>', 'Interesting abstract. I think I would have liked it more with a tighter crop to the places that are the sharpest.', '2020-01-30 08:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652032, 1245114, 61971, '<td valign="top">Cute silly portrait. I like the natural lighting. Hand, lips and nose are a little soft compared to the eye and hair which is distracting to me.</td>', 'Cute silly portrait. I like the natural lighting. Hand, lips and nose are a little soft compared to the eye and hair which is distracting to me.', '2020-01-30 08:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652033, 1245201, 61971, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, there is a huge pop of color in the graffiti on the one car that I wish was the focal point though.</td>', 'Interesting subject, there is a huge pop of color in the graffiti on the one car that I wish was the focal point though.', '2020-01-30 08:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652034, 1245066, 61971, '<td valign="top">Great composition, I love her expression. imo could have used a bump in the exposure.</td>', 'Great composition, I love her expression. imo could have used a bump in the exposure.', '2020-01-30 08:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652035, 1245046, 61971, '<td valign="top">Beautiful farm and the pond looks really cool. imo a little oversaturated with the blues and the bottom not going all the way across distracts rather than creates framing.</td>', 'Beautiful farm and the pond looks really cool. imo a little oversaturated with the blues and the bottom not going all the way across distracts rather than creates framing.', '2020-01-30 09:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652037, 1245262, 61971, '<td valign="top">He is an interesting fellow. :) the brightness by his tail area keeps drawing my eye away from his face though.</td>', 'He is an interesting fellow. :) the brightness by his tail area keeps drawing my eye away from his face though.', '2020-01-30 09:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652038, 1245299, 61971, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful scene. imo a little on the noisy side and there is a halo around the trees and their darkness pulls my eye away from the valley and the clouds. A crop on the right would have still allowed the cool sun rays without the distraction. A crop on the bottom would work well too.</td>', 'Very beautiful scene. imo a little on the noisy side and there is a halo around the trees and their darkness pulls my eye away from the valley and the clouds. A crop on the right would have still allowed the cool sun rays without the distraction. A crop on the bottom would work well too.', '2020-01-30 09:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652039, 1245181, 61971, '<td valign="top">Very pretty setting, imo a little bump down in the exposure or bump up in contrast would help get some separation between the mist and the scene.</td>', 'Very pretty setting, imo a little bump down in the exposure or bump up in contrast would help get some separation between the mist and the scene.', '2020-01-30 09:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
