(7652147, 1245330, 61971, '<td valign="top">Great b&amp;w tones here and artistic expression. My only thought would be a tighter crop on the right which is pulling at my attention.</td>', 'Great b&w tones here and artistic expression. My only thought would be a tighter crop on the right which is pulling at my attention.', '2020-01-30 15:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652148, 1245248, 86447, '<td valign="top">Golly!  Such a great high-speed capture!</td>', 'Golly!  Such a great high-speed capture!', '2020-01-30 15:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652149, 1245283, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love the capture.  I enjoy imagining what they''re doing and saying.<br/> <br/>The border, however, I''m not at all fond of.</td>', 'I love the capture.  I enjoy imagining what they''re doing and saying. The border, however, I''m not at all fond of.', '2020-01-30 15:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652150, 1245099, 61971, '<td valign="top">Very picturesque location nice dof and lighting. I would love to see it shot from one of the rooftops or to have more of the building in the shot.</td>', 'Very picturesque location nice dof and lighting. I would love to see it shot from one of the rooftops or to have more of the building in the shot.', '2020-01-30 15:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652151, 1245079, 61971, '<td valign="top">I love the contrasting colors and leading lines. The only distracting thing for me is that it is slightly of center.</td>', 'I love the contrasting colors and leading lines. The only distracting thing for me is that it is slightly of center.', '2020-01-30 15:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652152, 1245020, 61971, '<td valign="top">Great b&amp;w balance and contrast through this, love the composition.</td>', 'Great b&w balance and contrast through this, love the composition.', '2020-01-30 15:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652153, 1244889, 61971, '<td valign="top">What a majestic location. I love the painting of light on the mountains. The only part that is an off for me is that it looks like there is a lot of noise. imo you could have left the exposure bumped down a little which would have brought the light painting out even more. Great depth, it makes me want to walk/dream fly through this scene.</td>', 'What a majestic location. I love the painting of light on the mountains. The only part that is an off for me is that it looks like there is a lot of noise. imo you could have left the exposure bumped down a little which would have brought the light painting out even more. Great depth, it makes me want to walk/dream fly through this scene.', '2020-01-30 16:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652154, 1244930, 61971, '<td valign="top">Great color and composition. There is so much detail it makes me want to dive in and look at all the intricacies.</td>', 'Great color and composition. There is so much detail it makes me want to dive in and look at all the intricacies.', '2020-01-30 16:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652155, 1245242, 61971, '<td valign="top">This is such a cool photo. Perfect dof.</td>', 'This is such a cool photo. Perfect dof.', '2020-01-30 16:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652156, 1245270, 86447, '<td valign="top">absolutely STUNNING clarity and lighting.<br/> <br/>I''ve never seen a broken thing(s) be so beautiful before.<br/> <br/>I hope this does well for you!</td>', 'absolutely STUNNING clarity and lighting. I''ve never seen a broken thing(s) be so beautiful before. I hope this does well for you!', '2020-01-30 16:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652157, 1245269, 61971, '<td valign="top">Very pretty scene and nice sunset. My only thoughts would have been to step up into that bare patch and just allow the tan bushes and deep green bushes to frame the bottom of the mountain as the tree on the left and the brown bush on the bottom right keep pulling at my attention.</td>', 'Very pretty scene and nice sunset. My only thoughts would have been to step up into that bare patch and just allow the tan bushes and deep green bushes to frame the bottom of the mountain as the tree on the left and the brown bush on the bottom right keep pulling at my attention.', '2020-01-30 16:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652158, 1244941, 61971, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture. The color pops yet it overall feels soft and dreamy.</td>', 'I really like this picture. The color pops yet it overall feels soft and dreamy.', '2020-01-30 16:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652159, 1245043, 61971, '<td valign="top">Nice b&amp;w. I like the contrast of the tourists stopping to take it in vs the guy checking his watch in a rush to get wherever he is headed.</td>', 'Nice b&w. I like the contrast of the tourists stopping to take it in vs the guy checking his watch in a rush to get wherever he is headed.', '2020-01-30 16:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652160, 1245286, 61971, '<td valign="top">Very pretty shot, I love all the texture.</td>', 'Very pretty shot, I love all the texture.', '2020-01-30 16:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652161, 1244913, 61971, '<td valign="top">Great color contrast and texture. Nice find.</td>', 'Great color contrast and texture. Nice find.', '2020-01-30 16:15:29.000000', NULL, 1);
