(7652172, 1244822, 61971, '<td valign="top">I really like what you did artistically here. To make something that is so ugly (in my head these are orange) look so pretty with this b&amp;w treatment and lightning is really cool.</td>', 'I really like what you did artistically here. To make something that is so ugly (in my head these are orange) look so pretty with this b&w treatment and lightning is really cool.', '2020-01-30 16:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
