(7652183, 1245047, 61971, '<td valign="top">Northern lights are on my bucket list. Very pretty love all the curves and lines leading me around the picture. Love that it also had a witches brew feel int he swirl.</td>', 'Northern lights are on my bucket list. Very pretty love all the curves and lines leading me around the picture. Love that it also had a witches brew feel int he swirl.', '2020-01-30 16:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652184, 1245265, 61971, '<td valign="top">Love the b&amp;w, great portrait. I feel like he is giving us a peek into his soul.</td>', 'Love the b&w, great portrait. I feel like he is giving us a peek into his soul.', '2020-01-30 16:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652185, 1244785, 61971, '<td valign="top">So pretty, love the milky way.</td>', 'So pretty, love the milky way.', '2020-01-30 16:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652186, 1245248, 61971, '<td valign="top">He is so cool, great focus and lighting.</td>', 'He is so cool, great focus and lighting.', '2020-01-30 16:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652187, 1244907, 61971, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot, love the color, focus and texture.</td>', 'Awesome shot, love the color, focus and texture.', '2020-01-30 16:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652188, 1245334, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but badly processed (sorry) you have a white glow around everything from trying to bring out the bird and save the sky. It would have been much better to let the sky blow out and expose for the bird. Also the fish is now a strange color and there''s not enough contrast in the osprey.</td>', 'Nice shot, but badly processed (sorry) you have a white glow around everything from trying to bring out the bird and save the sky. It would have been much better to let the sky blow out and expose for the bird. Also the fish is now a strange color and there''s not enough contrast in the osprey.', '2020-01-30 17:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652189, 1244870, 156466, '<td valign="top">Did you try to remove the power lines? 2 minutes worth 2 points easy.</td>', 'Did you try to remove the power lines? 2 minutes worth 2 points easy.', '2020-01-30 17:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652190, 1245242, 156466, '<td valign="top">Would be so much more effective if you could minimize the impact of the background</td>', 'Would be so much more effective if you could minimize the impact of the background', '2020-01-30 17:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652191, 1244785, 156466, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Just a hint for the future, shots like this appear too dark against the light gray background here, but I suspect they pop against the dark backgrounds of Photoshop and Lightroom. Needs just a bump in the mids to give the bottom some definition here.</td>', 'Lovely. Just a hint for the future, shots like this appear too dark against the light gray background here, but I suspect they pop against the dark backgrounds of Photoshop and Lightroom. Needs just a bump in the mids to give the bottom some definition here.', '2020-01-30 17:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652192, 1245047, 156466, '<td valign="top">I recognize this place and the story behind it. Spectacular and well processed, but if I may say I liked your treatment on the other on a little better. It seemed to bring out some more detail in the surrounding areas. Still a ribbon for me. ;)</td>', 'I recognize this place and the story behind it. Spectacular and well processed, but if I may say I liked your treatment on the other on a little better. It seemed to bring out some more detail in the surrounding areas. Still a ribbon for me. ;)', '2020-01-30 17:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652194, 1244818, 156466, '<td valign="top">Stroke of luck there. Really nice. Using a lightning trigger?</td>', 'Stroke of luck there. Really nice. Using a lightning trigger?', '2020-01-30 17:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
