(7652336, 1245165, 30049, '<td valign="top">Fun capture!  This is near the top of my picks.  I know borders are quite opinionated and probably safe to stay away from, but in this case a nice gentle white border may have given you a bit more breathing room at the top (just a smidge tight with that beak right at the edge).  JMHO.  Overall, very nice!</td>', 'Fun capture!  This is near the top of my picks.  I know borders are quite opinionated and probably safe to stay away from, but in this case a nice gentle white border may have given you a bit more breathing room at the top (just a smidge tight with that beak right at the edge).  JMHO.  Overall, very nice!', '2020-01-31 17:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7652337, 1245335, 30049, '<td valign="top">Feel like I''ve seen this before (in the forums perhaps?).  Nonetheless, I like this as a "artsy" type image.  Just enough mystery to keep the viewer engaged.  Well done.</td>', 'Feel like I''ve seen this before (in the forums perhaps?).  Nonetheless, I like this as a "artsy" type image.  Just enough mystery to keep the viewer engaged.  Well done.', '2020-01-31 17:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
