(7652750, 1244909, 89220, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by JakeKurdsjuk:</b></div><hr/><i> Very striking but I''m struggling with a lack of detail in the pair of black abysses on either side. If there''s something to be seen there I can''t see it. I don''t want to see a lot of it, but I''d like to at least feel like something''s there. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I agree with you Jack. Will bring some light on the side(desert). Thanks for the suggestion.</td>', 'Originally posted by JakeKurdsjuk: Very striking but I''m struggling with a lack of detail in the pair of black abysses on either side. If there''s something to be seen there I can''t see it. I don''t want to see a lot of it, but I''d like to at least feel like something''s there.   I agree with you Jack. Will bring some light on the side(desert). Thanks for the suggestion.', '2020-02-05 00:24:27.000000', NULL, 0),
