(7652829, 1245168, 156466, '<td valign="top">Thought for sure this would do better than this. When I saw it I thought, "That''s got Mark written all over it". Hope you put those rocks back where you found them after you were done. ;)</td>', 'Thought for sure this would do better than this. When I saw it I thought, "That''s got Mark written all over it". Hope you put those rocks back where you found them after you were done. ;)', '2020-02-05 08:43:27.000000', NULL, 0),
