(7652839, 1245331, 100831, '<td valign="top">As is often with your images, I find myself in a quandary when judging and then am left wondering, later, why I didn''t bump or comment? The space and color are what make this one for me.  It feels at first like a snapshot but then grows from there.</td>', 'As is often with your images, I find myself in a quandary when judging and then am left wondering, later, why I didn''t bump or comment? The space and color are what make this one for me.  It feels at first like a snapshot but then grows from there.', '2020-02-05 11:25:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(7652840, 1245248, 112739, '<td valign="top">Congrats on HM Jake! Very hard capture to get and you managed to keep everything just right. <br/>I also experienced the trolls right before roll over.</td>', 'Congrats on HM Jake! Very hard capture to get and you managed to keep everything just right. I also experienced the trolls right before roll over.', '2020-02-05 11:26:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(7652842, 1245165, 112739, '<td valign="top">Well done Jane. Looks like a jealous onlooker just has to wait it''s Tern.</td>', 'Well done Jane. Looks like a jealous onlooker just has to wait it''s Tern.', '2020-02-05 11:30:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7652843, 1245331, 123833, '<td valign="top">Hi, Mariuca<br/>To be honest I have not noticed the guy high up, too much is happening below. I know you will kill me for this but I could have thought of many, many photos from Venice that I would have liked more :) Sorry about that, I gave this photo 5.</td>', 'Hi, MariucaTo be honest I have not noticed the guy high up, too much is happening below. I know you will kill me for this but I could have thought of many, many photos from Venice that I would have liked more :) Sorry about that, I gave this photo 5.', '2020-02-05 11:48:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7652846, 1244909, 9668, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the red ribbon, beautiful image and composition!</td>', 'Congrats on the red ribbon, beautiful image and composition!', '2020-02-05 12:09:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7652847, 1245255, 9668, '<td valign="top">Such a fun image you captured. Congrats on the red ribbon!</td>', 'Such a fun image you captured. Congrats on the red ribbon!', '2020-02-05 12:10:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(7652848, 1244785, 181847, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by JakeKurdsjuk:</b></div><hr/><i> Lovely. Just a hint for the future, shots like this appear too dark against the light gray background here, but I suspect they pop against the dark backgrounds of Photoshop and Lightroom. Needs just a bump in the mids to give the bottom some definition here. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I find your comment interesting. Wonder how much is related to how yours and my monitors are calibrated? I run two monitors, one which is (HD 1920x1200) calibrated well to the full sRGB color space. The second (UHD 4K 3820x2160) falls far short of the sRGB color space. On my good HD monitor I find that it "pops" nicely. On the UHD there is far more of the light gray background, white space and it doesn''t look as good on it.</td>', 'Originally posted by JakeKurdsjuk: Lovely. Just a hint for the future, shots like this appear too dark against the light gray background here, but I suspect they pop against the dark backgrounds of Photoshop and Lightroom. Needs just a bump in the mids to give the bottom some definition here.   I find your comment interesting. Wonder how much is related to how yours and my monitors are calibrated? I run two monitors, one which is (HD 1920x1200) calibrated well to the full sRGB color space. The second (UHD 4K 3820x2160) falls far short of the sRGB color space. On my good HD monitor I find that it "pops" nicely. On the UHD there is far more of the light gray background, white space and it doesn''t look as good on it.', '2020-02-05 12:17:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(7652849, 1244818, 34171, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot and a well deserved blue.  Congrats buddy.</td>', 'Awesome shot and a well deserved blue.  Congrats buddy.', '2020-02-05 12:36:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(7652855, 1244902, 173844, '<td valign="top">Extraordinary photograph, monumental yet intimate.  Nice palette of tones and textures.  This horse looks free. <br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Extraordinary photograph, monumental yet intimate.  Nice palette of tones and textures.  This horse looks free. Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2020-02-05 16:14:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7652856, 1245047, 114285, '<td valign="top">Really stunning shot! Pretty sure you know that there are some people on here that truly do not like colourful landscapes. You cant please everyone all the time :-)</td>', 'Really stunning shot! Pretty sure you know that there are some people on here that truly do not like colourful landscapes. You cant please everyone all the time :-)', '2020-02-05 18:49:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(7652857, 1245047, 112739, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> Really stunning shot! Pretty sure you know that there are some people on here that truly do not like colourful landscapes. You cant please everyone all the time :-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Anita, appreciate it. Yes, I know that. I have edited my comments on the image. I''m over my fit. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2020-02-05 22:51:50.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: Really stunning shot! Pretty sure you know that there are some people on here that truly do not like colourful landscapes. You cant please everyone all the time :-)   Thanks Anita, appreciate it. Yes, I know that. I have edited my comments on the image. I''m over my fit. ', '2020-02-05 19:16:15.000000', '2020-02-05 22:51:50.000000', 0),
